\tune sets the tuning frequency of A4, used when notes
are converted to frequencies. The default is 440.
It takes one argument, a number greater than 0, which can
be a decimal:

\tune 442
\tune 431.5

The frequency is used for the notes an instrument sends
via OSC (unless it sends MIDI notes with its sendmidi
method) and for the notes sent to Python. It does not
affect notes sent through MIDI ports.
